---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config.mjs';
---
<PageLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" eyebrow="Transparency" lastUpdated={SITE.legalLastUpdated} description={`How ${SITE.name} earns money through affiliate links, and how we keep our side-sleeper comfort guides honest and independent.`}>
  <p class="callout"><strong>In short:</strong> {SITE.affiliateDisclosureShort}</p>

  <h2>What affiliate links are</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} participates in affiliate programs. This means some links on our pages are special tracking links. If
    you click one and make a purchase, the retailer or brand may pay us a small commission. The price you pay is the
    same whether you use our link or not.
  </p>

  <h2>Which programs we may use</h2>
  <p>
    We may participate in programs run by individual brands and by affiliate networks or marketplaces. If we
    participate in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, the following applies: <em>As an Amazon Associate, we
    earn from qualifying purchases.</em>
  </p>

  <h2>How affiliate links are marked</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every article that contains affiliate links displays a disclosure box near the top of the page.</li>
    <li>Product buttons open in a new tab and are tagged for search engines as sponsored links.</li>
    <li>This disclosure is linked from the footer of every page.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Our editorial independence</h2>
  <p>
    Commissions never decide what we write. Our guides are research-based: we compare product types, materials and
    designs and describe who they may suit and what their drawbacks are. We do not accept payment for positive
    coverage, and we do not claim to have tested products we have not tested. If we ever publish sponsored content, it
    will be clearly labeled.
  </p>

  <h2>Prices and availability</h2>
  <p>Prices, promotions and availability change often and are set by retailers. Always confirm the final details on the retailer's site before buying.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>If you have any questions about this disclosure, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
